# Hosted SGLang worker router flags for zai-org/GLM-5.3.
# Append them to every hosted worker's command line so its model card carries
# the worker set's `router_config`. The proxies advertise the same values, and
# the card checksum includes `router_config`, so a mismatch splits the set.
# `--router-mode` is required: without it `build_router_config` advertises
# nothing and the frontend-wide config applies.
--router-mode kv --router-track-active-blocks --no-router-track-output-blocks --shared-cache-multiplier 0.5
